option.SPACE_STARS.comment=O quão brilhantes as estrelas ficam acima da atmosfera. Defina como zero para manter o espaço preto.
option.COLORED_GODRAYS=Raios de luz coloridos
option.COLORED_GODRAYS.comment=Tints light shafts that pass through stained glass. Costs an extra shadow lookup per step, so it is off by default.
option.PBR_MODE=Modo de materiais
option.PBR_MODE.comment=LabPBR reads normal and specular maps from a PBR resource pack for surface detail, ambient occlusion, specular highlights, metals and emission. Integrated (experimental) builds bump detail and shine from the block textures themselves, so it works with any pack, including vanilla.
