option.INT_PBR_BUMP.comment=How strongly texture brightness is turned into surface relief in Integrated mode.
option.INT_PBR_SHINE=Brilho integrado
option.INT_PBR_SHINE.comment=How glossy light, smooth surfaces get in Integrated mode. Busy textures like stone and dirt stay matte.
option.PBR_NORMAL_STRENGTH=Intensidade do normal PBR
option.PBR_SPECULAR_STRENGTH=Intensidade especular PBR
option.PBR_EMISSION_STRENGTH=Intensidade de emissão PBR
