option.FOG_SUN_SCATTER=Brilho do sol na névoa
option.FOG_SUN_SCATTER.comment=How much the fog and distant haze glow and warm toward the sun and cool away from it. Set to zero for evenly colored fog.
option.AURORA_BIOME=Local da aurora
option.AURORA_BIOME.comment=Where the aurora appears. Snowy biomes only is the default: the aurora fades in slowly when you enter a snowy biome and fades away when you leave. Everywhere keeps it in the sky in every biome.
