value.AURORA_BIOME.1=Em toda parte
option.NIGHT_AIRGLOW=Airglow noturno
option.NIGHT_AIRGLOW.comment=A very faint rippled teal and violet glow low in the night sky, like the real airglow bands seen from dark places. Set to zero to turn it off.
option.AURORA_COVERAGE=Cobertura da aurora
option.AURORA_COVERAGE.comment=How much of the sky the silky aurora ribbons fill. Classic is a few calm, broad ribbons. Wide fills most of the sky. Full sky packs in more ribbons with fewer dark gaps.
