value.MOON_STYLE.2=Lua redonda
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_DETAIL=Detalhe das nuvens vanilla
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_DETAIL.comment=Fast draws one flat cloud layer and is much lighter on the GPU. Fancy draws the full 3D cloud blocks and can cost a lot of FPS.
