option.VANILLA_CLOUD_ROUNDNESS.comment=Rounds the corners of each vanilla cloud cell so they read as puffy, separated clumps instead of flat blocks. 0 keeps the original hard cubes.
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_CELL_SIZE=Tamanho das nuvens vanilla
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_CELL_SIZE.comment=How large each rounded puff is (only visible once roundness is above 0). Larger sizes avoid a repeating grid look on big cloud clusters.
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_SOFTNESS=Suavidade da borda das nuvens vanilla
option.VANILLA_CLOUD_SOFTNESS.comment=Blurs and fades each cloud puff's edge into a gentle, storybook-soft outline instead of a crisp cutout, with a faint sunlit rim.
option.POM_MODE=Mapeamento de oclusão de paralaxe
option.POM_MODE.comment=Reads the height map from a LabPBR resource pack to give blocks real depth, like mortar lines sinking between bricks. Needs a PBR-compatible texture pack and costs some FPS.
